[patterns/application/micro-frontend/PTN-APP-MFE-008-micro-frontend-integration-overview.md#variation-1-synchronous-event-pattern-event-bus-with-acknowledgment]

#### Variation 1: Synchronous Event Pattern (Event Bus with Acknowledgment)

**Standard Event Bus**: Fire-and-forget, no response guarantees

**Variation**: Event Bus with acknowledgment tracking for critical workflows:

```typescript
// Publisher waits for acknowledgments
const acknowledgments = await eventBus.publishWithAck(
  'payment.initiated',
  paymentData,
  { timeout: 5000, expectedAcks: 2 }
);

if (acknowledgments.length < 2) {
  // Handle partial failure
  console.warn('Not all subscribers acknowledged payment event');
}

// Subscribers send acknowledgment
eventBus.subscribe('payment.initiated', async (event) => {
  await processPayment(event.paymentId);
  return { success: true }; // Acknowledgment
});
```

**Use When**: Critical workflows requiring confirmation of processing (e.g., payment, eligibility updates)

