[patterns/application/micro-frontend/PTN-APP-MFE-008-micro-frontend-integration-overview.md#variation-2-backend-driven-shell-props-server-side-rendering]

#### Variation 2: Backend-Driven Shell Props (Server-Side Rendering)

**Standard Shell Props**: Client-side initialization of shared props

**Variation**: Server-side rendering with props injected at build/deploy time:

```typescript
// Server renders shell with props from environment
export function getServerSideProps(context) {
  return {
    props: {
      user: null, // Authenticated on client
      config: {
        apiBaseUrl: process.env.API_BASE_URL,
        featureFlags: JSON.parse(process.env.FEATURE_FLAGS),
        environment: process.env.ENVIRONMENT,
      },
    },
  };
}
```

**Use When**: Reducing client-side initialization latency, SEO requirements, static configuration

