[patterns/application/micro-frontend/PTN-APP-MFE-008-micro-frontend-integration-overview.md#variation-4-hybrid-backend--event-pattern-optimistic-ui-updates]

#### Variation 4: Hybrid Backend + Event Pattern (Optimistic UI Updates)

**Standard Backend API**: Wait for backend response before updating UI

**Variation**: Publish event immediately for optimistic UI update, confirm with backend:

```typescript
// Optimistic update via event
eventBus.publish('claim.submitting', { claimId: tempId, status: 'pending' });

// Backend confirmation
const claim = await claimsApi.submitClaim(claimData);

// Publish final state
eventBus.publish('claim.submitted', { claimId: claim.id, status: 'submitted' });
```

**Use When**: Improving perceived performance, workflows with high success rate, rollback capability

