#### Before: Tightly Coupled Micro-Frontends

**Problem State:**

```typescript
// Claims MFE directly imports from Provider MFE
import { ProviderLookup } from '@gainwell/provider-mfe/components';

function ClaimForm() {
  // Direct component import creates build-time dependency
  return (
    <form>
      <ProviderLookup onSelect={setProvider} />
      <ClaimDetails provider={provider} />
    </form>
  );
}
```

**Issues:**
- **Build-Time Coupling**: Claims MFE must coordinate deployment with Provider MFE
- **Version Lock-In**: Both modules must upgrade in lockstep
- **Testing Complexity**: Integration tests require full Provider MFE build
- **Deployment Risk**: Provider MFE changes can break Claims MFE unexpectedly

**Metrics (Before):**
- Deployment Frequency: 2-4 deployments/week (coordinated releases)
- Integration Test Time: 25 minutes (full cross-module build)
- Rollback Complexity: High (both modules must rollback together)
- Team Autonomy: Low (cross-team coordination required)

