**Cost Savings:**
- **Developer Productivity**: Reduced integration test time enables faster development iteration
- **Incident Response**: Independent rollback reduces MTTR from 2 hours to 15 minutes = 87% faster incident resolution
- **Team Velocity**: 5x deployment frequency = faster feature delivery and business value realization
